// CHECK:   --> products {{(?:.*[/\\])?hash_lbrack_split_reject_neg_01\.zom:1:1$}}
// CHECK-LITERAL:   |
// CHECK-LITERAL: 1 | # [attr]
// CHECK-LITERAL:   | ^
// CHECK-LITERAL: Note [ZOM2058]: To start an attribute, write #[path::to::attribute].
// CHECK:   --> products {{(?:.*[/\\])?hash_lbrack_split_reject_neg_01\.zom:1:1$}}
// CHECK-LITERAL:   |
// CHECK-LITERAL: 1 | # [attr]
// CHECK-LITERAL:   | ^
// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM2076]: Unexpected token expected
// CHECK:   --> products {{(?:.*[/\\])?hash_lbrack_split_reject_neg_01\.zom:1:1$}}
// CHECK-LITERAL:   |
// CHECK-LITERAL: 1 | # [attr]
// CHECK-LITERAL:   | ^
